<title>UK: NWE gasoline flat to a touch firmer, but slow.</title>
<headline>NWE gasoline flat to a touch firmer, but slow.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical gasoline was broadly steady although swaps were seen to have consolidated by $1 or so from Monday's levels.</p>
<p>Premium unleaded barges were talked around $184-185 fob ARA, but few traders appeared interested in material.</p>
<p>&quot;I think the market wants to see what NYMEX will do,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>The closing arbitrage window to the United States was also exerting some bearish pressure.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
